daisyUI (https://daisyui.com, https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui)

Used in @talisman-cms/plugin-ui-daisyui. The built-in theme colour palettes in
src/admin/themeDefaults.ts are transcribed from daisyUI's theme definitions.
